                           :eq77 "multivariate Laplace-encoded energy as precision-weighted sum of squared errors (per C453)" :eq78-79 "prediction errors (per C453)" :eq84 "precision as inverse variance (per C453)" :eq48-50 "recognition dynamics as gradient descent (per C453)" :eq82-86 "precision-weighted errors (per C453)"}
